119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 85 0 R
/T (The Scholarship & Financial Aid Management System is a database-driven desktop application designed to manage student information, scholarship records and scholarship applications in a structured manner. The system uses Python with Tkinter for the graphical user interface and MySQL for persistent data storage. The database contains related entities such as Department, Course, Student, Donor, Scholarship, Eligibility_Criteria, Application, Document, Staff_Admin, Disbursement, Payment and Donation. Primary keys and foreign keys are used to maintain referential integrity. The application provides viewing, insertion and updating operations through a simple desktop UI, while SQL queries support reporting and analysis.)
/E (The Scholarship & Financial Aid Management System is a database-driven desktop application designed to manage student information, scholarship records and scholarship applications in a structured manner. The system uses Python with Tkinter for the graphical user interface and MySQL for persistent data storage. The database contains related entities such as Department, Course, Student, Donor, Scholarship, Eligibility_Criteria, Application, Document, Staff_Admin, Disbursement, Payment and Donation. Primary keys and foreign keys are used to maintain referential integrity. The application provides viewing, insertion and updating operations through a simple desktop UI, while SQL queries support reporting and analysis.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
